    "https://www.beloit.edu/admission/admitted-students/#deposit": {
      "title": "Beloit College",
      "description": "Admitted Students  • Admissions  • Beloit College Top of page Deposit Visit Request Info Give Give News Calendar For Beloiters Beloit College Deposit Visit Request Info Give Give News Calendar For Beloiters Academics Admissions Student Life Athletics Alumni Our Story Search Beloit College Search Beloit College Home Admissions Admitted Students Admitted Students You’ve done the hard part — you’re in! Now it’s time to imagine your future. We can’t wait to see who you become at Beloit. The world needs more people who are both optimistic and effective, compassionate and entrepreneurial, open to wonder and capable of building a future that works for everyone — people with more imagination, more ingenuity, more humanity. The world needs you . So, are you a #futurebeloiter? I’m ready to enroll and make my deposit I’m looking to learn more about Beloit I have already deposited – what’s next? Welcome from President Boynton Ready to Deposit? When you’ve decided Beloit feels like home, please let us know. Sign into your Applicant Status Page and submit your Candidate’s Reply Form and enrollment deposit. The Candidate’s Reply Form is simple — just check a box to confirm you’d like to accept our offer of admission. Once you’ve submitted the Candidate’s Reply Form, you’ll see a link to pay your $350 enrollment deposit on your status page. The link does not require a login, so you can copy the link and send it to a parent or other supporter if they will be helping you pay the deposit. $100 from your deposit will be applied to your first student bill. $250 will be credited to your account upon graduation. Once you’ve paid your deposit, you’ll hear from a faculty ambassador in the Advanced Mentoring Program, and you can scroll down for a timeline of next steps and additional resources. But take a moment to celebrate first! Congratulations and welcome to the community! Complete your Enrollment Deposited Students Explore the New Buccaneers pages for detailed information and next steps on your journey to Beloit! REGISTER FOR SUMMER ORIENTATION TODAY Key Dates and Deadlines for students entering Fall 2026: April 1: Advanced Mentoring Program (AMP) Advisor Matching Quiz and Housing Questionnaire become available. May 15: Advanced Mentoring Program (AMP) Advisor Matching Quiz and Housing Questionnaire due. June 18: Summer Orientation, in-person campus session (attendance of either in-person or virtual orientation is mandatory) July 7-8: Summer Orientation, virtual sessions (attendance of either in-person or virtual orientation is mandatory) July 7-8: Advanced Mentoring Program (AMP) first Group Advising Sessions. July 13-24: Individual, online AMP Advising and Registration appointments. August 14: New International Student Move-In August 19: New Domestic Student Move-In August 20-23: New Student Days August 24: Convocation and First Day of Classes September 18-20: Beloiter Days (Homecoming, Reunion and Friends & Family weekend) New Buccaneers Get to know Beloit We’re here to help you immerse yourself in the Beloit community, on campus or from afar. (Re-) Visit Campus Offered year-round There is no better way to confirm that Beloit is your college home than to spend time here. Explore campus, attend a class, eat at Hamilton’s, connect with faculty and staff, meet fellow future Beloiters, and celebrate! SIGN UP Connect with future classmates on ZeeMee Get started now Whether you are committed or still deciding, ZeeMee is a great way to connect with students who share your interests and maybe even find your future roommate! If you aren’t already part of the Beloit College student community on Zeemee, download the free app to get started. Join in on ZeeMee Explore Our Virtual Tour Get started now Can’t travel to Beloit, Wisconsin? Can’t wait to see our campus? Explore a diverse and unique small city and get to know an innovative liberal arts college known for putting students first. Take the Virtual Tour Meet Your Admissions Counselor Offered year-round Our staff is standing by to answer your questions and help connect you to the community. Whether you talk to your admissions counselor multiple times a week or you’re not quite sure who your counselor is, you are always welcome and encouraged to schedule a meeting. We love connecting with students. Find your Counselor Get your Beloit Swag Show your pride We know it’s not official until you debut your Beloit College t-shirt (sweatshirt, fleece, socks, beanie, you get the idea) to friends and family (and maybe even social media)! This is also a great link to share with friends and family if you have a graduation or birthday party coming up. Shop our Spirit Store We can’t wait to see what you do at Beloit and in the world. Deposit at Beloit Beloit College Offices & Services Employment Directions Privacy Policy Editor Login Follow Beloit College on Instagram Follow Beloit College on Facebook Follow Beloit College on X/Twitter Follow Beloit College on LinkedIn Follow Beloit College on YouTube 700 College St., Beloit, Wisconsin 53511 608-363-2000 © 2026 Beloit College. All Rights Reserved. Back to top of page This site uses cookies to improve your experience. Read our Web Privacy Policy for more information. Got it! ×"
