      "description": "Student Job Openings  • Human Resources  • Beloit College Top of page Deposit Visit Request Info Give Give News Calendar For Beloiters Beloit College Deposit Visit Request Info Give Give News Calendar For Beloiters Academics Admissions Student Life Athletics Alumni Our Story Search Beloit College Search Beloit College Human Resources Faculty & Staff Opportunities Student Job Openings Employee Resources Student Worker Resources Holiday Schedule Contact Us Related Links Career Works Home Human Resources Student Job Openings Student Job Openings Working on campus provides students with a valuable extension to the educational experience at Beloit while earning money to help meet expenses. Looking for campus work? Before a student can begin employment, they must have their payroll forms completed with our payroll department.  Documents needed to complete these forms are the following: U.S. Passport or Driver’s License, Social Security Card, and Birth Certificate.  Photocopies, scanned copies, and expired documents will not be accepted. Open campus student work positions Advancement  – Advancement Media Assistant Advancement – Advancement Special Project Assistant Anthropology – Department Assistant, Anthropology Art – Art Nude Model Athletics – Athletic Game Day Event Worker Athletics – Athletic Training Aide Athletics – Athletics - Creative Team Athletics – Athletics - In-Game Worker Athletics – Athletics - Men’s Lacrosse Manager Athletics – Athletics - Public Address Announcer Athletics – Athletics - Strength and Conditioning Intern Athletics – Athletics - Team Manager (Baseball) Athletics – Athletics Laundry Athletics – Athletics Sports Center Monitors Athletics – Baseball Field Crew Athletics – Football Gameday Event Crew Athletics – Football Team Manager Athletics – Softball Team Manager Athletics – Sports Statistician (Multiple Sports) Athletics – Sportscenter Laundry Athletics – Team Manager (Women’s Basketball) Athletics – Women’s Basketball Social Media Manager Athletics – Women’s Basketball Workout Player Athletics - Sports Information – Color Commentator (Multiple Sports) Bon Appetit – D.K.’s Cashier/Foodservice Worker Bon Appetit Dining – Hamiltons Foodservice Worker Front of House Bon Appetit-Dining – Hamiltons Foodservice Worker Back of House Campus Recreation – Campus Recreation Student Assistant Campus Recreation – Game Day Student Shuttle Driver CELEB – Audio Recording Intern IV CELEB – Beloit TV Assistant II CELEB – Beloit TV Assistant IV CELEB – Gallery ABBA Assistant CELEB – MakerLab Assistant II CELEB – MakerLab Supervisor Econ and Business – Teaching Assistant - Econ/Business Geology – Geology Department Assistant Geology – Geology Department Course Assistant Geology – Geology Department Research Assistant Human Resources – HR Office Assistant Intercultural (SSEC) – Grace’s Place Attendant Library – Library Acquisitions Assistant Library – Library Resource Assistant Logan Museum – Logan Museum - Attendant Morse Library – Archives and Special Collections Worker PART – Office Assistant - PART PART – Office Assistant 2 - PART PART – Office Assistant Supervisor - PART Performing Arts – Costume Assistant Performing Arts – Costume Technician Performing Arts – Costume Technician Supervisor Performing Arts – Lead Costume Technician Powerhouse – Powerhouse Student Building Assistant Residence Life  – RESL Shuttle Drivers Residential Life – RESL Building Assistant Residential Life  – RESL Office Assistant School of Environment & Sustainability – School of Environment & Sustainability Student Assistant School of Global and Public Service – Global & Public Service Program Assistant SEAL – SEAL Financial Assistant Faculty & staff Creating a new campus position? New campus positions must first be submitted to Human Resources for review and approval before they may be posted or hired for. Completed job descriptions should be submitted to humanresources@beloit.edu . Download the Template Looking to hire students for campus work? Faculty and staff are required to post their open positions so all students have the opportunity to apply. Submit a Student Job Opening Onboarding a new student worker? There are many things that you and each student need to do or discuss. To help, please make use of the Beloit College Student Worker & Supervisor Checklist to track that everything is addressed and documented. Beloit College Offices & Services Employment Directions Privacy Policy Editor Login Follow Beloit College on Instagram Follow Beloit College on Facebook Follow Beloit College on X/Twitter Follow Beloit College on LinkedIn Follow Beloit College on YouTube 700 College St., Beloit, Wisconsin 53511 608-363-2000 © 2026 Beloit College. All Rights Reserved. Back to top of page This site uses cookies to improve your experience. Read our Web Privacy Policy for more information. Got it! ×"
